01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
The Seed is the 2021 science fiction body horror feature film
directorial debut of Sam Walker, who also wrote the script.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The movie premiered in the United States at Beyond Fest, after which it
was released to Shudder as one of its original films.

11
